Use always-mounted supplied sources; manual items only when selected; auto items only when relevant to the work object (same name/directory is a hint, not proof); agent items only when needed to close an identified evidence gap. Full text is evidence, summary is an excerpt, index/path is only a pointer: do not claim to have read missing full text. Channel permissions gate every read.
