Markdown contract: start at byte 1 with ---; put header keys and JSON-quoted string values (or valid YAML arrays) on separate lines; close with ---. Each block is exactly “## <configured title>” followed immediately on the next line by “<!-- type: <configured type> -->”, then Markdown body. Use ### or deeper headings inside bodies; balance code fences. No preamble or outer code fence in the file.

Destination: /fixture/rebirth. Create exactly one new .md file with a descriptive basename (no path separators, control characters, <>:"|?*, or trailing dot/space; not SKILL.md). Do not invent an R-number. If it exists choose an unused suffix, never overwrite.
Archive mode dir: use /fixture/rebirth exactly; set folder to "" in JSON and, if emitted, YAML. Do not create a child folder.
Before writing, validate the complete draft against the contract. Write through the permitted channel, then reread and compare the full saved text and block/header structure. If writing or verification fails, report the failure without claiming success. On success reply only “已写入 <actual path>”."
